# ============================================================
# Track the experiment directories IN FULL:
#   comparison/ · configs/ · mae_anomaly/ · docs/ · scripts/
# Ignore everything else at repo root, plus the only bulky things
# inside the tracked dirs: the 12 GB comparison/results/ output
# tree and Python __pycache__.
# ============================================================

# 1) ignore every root-level entry, then whitelist what we track
/*
!/comparison/
!/configs/
!/mae_anomaly/
!/docs/
!/scripts/
!/README.md
!/ablation_guideline.md
!/set_guideline.md
!/setup.py
!/requirements.txt
!/examples/
!/.gitignore

# 2) the only exclusions inside the tracked dirs
comparison/results/
**/__pycache__/
